{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order. That is a reverse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component to an earlier one, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reversed()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":", so on a graph whose vertex","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"positions are insertion order (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On any graph, one pass over ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lists them in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, O(V):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(V + E).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","abstract":[],"title":"Connectivity","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/stronglyConnectedComponents()":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Tarjan’s algorithm.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"GraphProtocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols","type":"topic","abstract":[]},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"DirectedGraph","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"abstract":[]},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/Components":{"abstract":[{"text":"A partition of a graph’s vertices into components, in a documented order: a collection of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components, each a slice of vertices in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, with an O(1) ","type":"text"},{"code":"component(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"Components","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Components","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/components","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}